{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287170/extras/b421b6adaa438d2507260bb9f9a2d54a.avif?t=1769252259\" width=336 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You suddenly arrive in a strange facility. You and 14 others are made to compete  in a series of challenges, hosted by the mysterious 'Lady Luck.' To survive they must complete all of Luck's Challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the truth of Lady Luck's game, and find your way out of this strange new world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287170/extras/a9d8c0ab282f504b1f13df63950df928.poster.avif?t=1769252259\" width=586 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287170/extras/a9d8c0ab282f504b1f13df63950df928.webm?t=1769252259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287170/extras/a9d8c0ab282f504b1f13df63950df928.mp4?t=1769252259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287170/extras/6a8e42a3d40b97699d44ca971168cd33.avif?t=1769252259\" width=336 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thief's Roulette is a 1st-person <strong>puzzle adventure</strong> with a cryptic story to unravel. At the core of the game is a series of challenges conducted by Lady Luck. You will face a variety of puzzles and obstacles as you make your way to the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thief's Roulette is not a visual novel, but does feature VN style scenes and conversations.\u00a0<